~ start
$> GlobalVars.tac_visited = true
Tac: hmmm
- Good morning
Tac: Oh, good morning!
- You seem troubled
- What are you thinking about?
=> quest_start

~ start50
$> GlobalVars.tac_visited = true
Tac: hmmm
- Good afternoon
Tac: Oh, good afternoon!
- You seem troubled
- What are you thinking about?
=> quest_start

~ start70
$> GlobalVars.tac_visited = true
Tac: hmmm... [speed=1.5][font_size=10] I can't seem to be able to move anymore!?!
- Good afternoon
Tac: Oh, good afternoon!
- You seem troubled
- What are you doing about?
=> quest_start

~ quest_start
Tac: I was thinking about my friend Tic
Tac: Do you know them?
if GlobalVars.tic_visited:
	- Yes, I do
else:
	- No, I don't
Tac: Yesterday they hit me!
- Oh
- So mean!
Tac: Yeah, that's what I told myself.
Tac: I got really angry!
Tac: But then I thought about it!
Tac: We've been friends for as long as I remember, and they never hit me!
Tac: And I think I might've been rude to them when we were deciding what cake to bake for Bibi's birthday.
Tac: Can you talk to Tic, tell them I'm sorry?
if GlobalVars.tac_visited:
	- I just talked to them!
		=> quest_return_main
else:
	- I can do that for you
		Tac: What a relief!
	- Sorry, I have other things to do
		Tac: Understandable...
	Tac: Good luck!
	$> title = "quest_return"
=> END

~ quest_return
Tac: Have you had time to talk to them?
if GlobalVars.tic_visited:
	- Yeah, I just did!
		=> quest_return_main
else:
	- No, sorry...
	Tac: Understandable...
=> END

~ quest_return_main
Tac: Oh! And what was their answer?
- They're really sorry too
	Tac: Really!
	Tac: Then I musn't wait any longer and go talk to them!
	=> good_ending
- They hate you, and don't want to talk to you ever again!
	Tac: Oh...
	Tac: It's... Okay...
	Tac: I guess I'll live my life without my best friend from now on...
	Tac: ....
	=> bad_ending
=> END

~ good_ending
$> title = "good_ending"
Tac: What a relief!
=> END

~ good_ending60
$> title = "good_ending"
Tac: What a relief!
Tac: I have a feeling I should get going!
=> END

~ good_ending75
$> title = "good_ending"
Tac: What a relief!
Tac: I have a feeling I should get going!
Tac: But somehow I can't seem to move!
Tac: Do you know why that is?
- I can move fine
	Tac: Odd, If you find anything, let me know
- I'll investigate
	Tac: Thank you!
=> END

~ bad_ending
$> title = "bad_ending"
Tac: [wave amp=30 freq=1] How unfortunate...
Tac: [wave amp=20 freq=1] Do you have a tissue for me to cry in?
- Here you go
	Tac: [wave amp=20 freq=1] Thank youuuuu
- No, sorry
	Tac: [wave amp=30 freq=1] Understandable...
=> END

~ bad_ending60
$> title = "bad_ending"
Tac: [wave amp=30 freq=1] How unfortunate...
Tac: [wave amp=20 freq=1] Do you have a tissue for me to cry in?
- Here you go
	Tac: [wave amp=20 freq=1] Thank youuuuu
- No, sorry
	Tac: [wave amp=30 freq=1] Understandable...
Tac: Could you bring me to a cliff, I feel like bungee jumping
- You're too heavy
	Tac: Unfortunate
- Bungee jumping?
	Tac: Nevermind...
- Can't you walk
	Tac: It seems I can't, no...
=> END

~ bad_ending75
$> title = "bad_ending"
Tac: [wave amp=20 freq=1] Could you bring me to a cliff [/wave], I feel like bungee jumping
